Ladybird now defers microtasks until a layout update is done, the
re-snap of scroll containers after layout included. Blink forbids
script throughout layout: LocalFrameView::PerformLayout() takes a
ScriptForbiddenScope. Gecko holds an nsAutoScriptBlocker while its
PresShell flushes style and layout, in DoFlushPendingNotifications().
And WebKit takes a ScriptDisallowedScope in LocalFrameViewLayoutContext::
performLayout(). All three come from reading the engines’ sources.
